Well, I think it is probably dead wrong for Lojban, because I think Lojban would come down for the {pu roroi naku} solution (i.e., that {pu} = {pu su'oroi}) and I am reasonably sure that it was thus in Loglan and ever since (I remember looking in Loglan for convenient expressions for the duals of {pu} and {ba} ).  
